jobs.description:
- Loading, transporting and unloading various goods in an efficient and safe manner;
• Spotting and recording irregularities;
• Checking that the correct freight documents are present;
• Properly executing procedures and work instructions;
• You will ensure the proper registration and reporting of complaints and damages;
• Checking the vehicle daily for damage;
• Taking care of sorting out and clearing packaging;
• Delivering to our customer on time.

Functie-eisen:
- You are customer-oriented;
• You are stress-resistant and have a flexible attitude;
• You have a command of the English language;
• You enjoy being on the road;
• You are in a good physical condition;
• You are available for 28 to 40 hours per week; 
• You communicate accurately and clearly.
